  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1503.01 Eligible Properties",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1503.01 Eligible Properties. Properties with an impacted well which have not received an offer of alternate water from a third party, pursuant to Env-Or 603.04, are eligible for a rebate pursuant to this Chapter.\n\nSource. #14201, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1500.html"
